1,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I believe we should look for a proposal that is stable and reliable for everyone, regardless of the circumstances. What do you all think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Shizue. Stability is key, but we must also ensure that the expansion doesn't inadvertently create new barriers. We should consider how physical location and timing affect who can actually access these services.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should check if we've tried these ideas before! Why guess if we can just look at what happened last time? We shouldn't just pick what sounds cool right now.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I quite agree with Rin. It would be a pity to repeat past mistakes with such enthusiasm. I am also curious about the structural nature of our funding to ensure this expansion doesn't wither by year two.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with all of you. However, we must also ensure that the staff have the actual skills and capacity to manage these new services without becoming overwhelmed. We need a realistic assessment of our human resources.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Those are all very thoughtful points. To make sure we don't rely too heavily on things we cannot control, perhaps we should look into the winter road closures north of the river and the bus links in the outer wards?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Those are excellent suggestions, Shizue. To build on that, I would like to examine the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to understand current access patterns.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to see the attendance sheets from former outreach stops and those two programmes begun six years ago! Let's see what actually worked before we decide on something new.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach, Rin. To complement that, I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year. Let us see where the money actually goes.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I will look into the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. We must verify if the necessary expertise exists before committing staff to new tasks.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. I am glad we are all considering the practical side of things. I feel much more comfortable knowing we are looking at the details together.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a relief to see such a balanced approach. By examining both the financial constraints and the physical accessibility, we can ensure the chosen service truly serves the whole community.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just excited to see what's hidden in the old files! It's like a treasure hunt for ideas. I bet we'll find something awesome that everyone just forgot about!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Rin. Though I suspect the ""treasure"" may be more of a cautionary tale than a hidden gem. Still, a bit of archival detective work is far better than blind optimism.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. By combining our findings on funding, accessibility, and personnel, we can make a decision based on evidence rather than assumptions. I look forward to seeing the results.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us proceed with these choices. I hope the information we find helps us create something that will bring joy and stability to our community for many years to come.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I concur. I look forward to seeing how these different pieces of information fit together to help us reach a fair and inclusive decision for everyone.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find the best clues ever! Let's get started so we can see what the records say!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Very well. I shall dive into the ledgers and grant terms. I look forward to discovering whether our financial foundations are as solid as we hope, or merely a clever illusion.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will begin my research into the volunteer and certification records. It is vital that we do not overextend our team without a clear plan for who will actually execute the work.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
